### Ask a pattern question
POST http://localhost:8083/graph-rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which patients have diabetes and also take metformin?"
}

### Ask about observations
POST http://localhost:8083/graph-rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What conditions appear together with hypertension in this cohort?"
}

### Ask a cohort summary question
POST http://localhost:8083/graph-rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Summarize the most common conditions across all patients."
}
